// C-DAG: return a == b;
//
// LL-DAG: define dso_local i64 @ret_wide_declared(i64
// LL-DAG: define dso_local i32 @ret_wide_narrowed(i64
// LL-DAG: trunc i64 %{{.*}} to i32
//
// ERR-DAG: Diag Error: {{.*}}lossy lift [return-narrowed]
// ERR-DAG: Diag Error: {{.*}}lossy lift [return-synthesized]
// ERR: Skipping code generation due to prior diagnostics errors
